  {
   "say": "Military rule in the West Bank since nineteen sixty-seven. Record settler attacks.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "say": "If I were Israel, I'd have done it differently.",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "say": "Applause, without ever doing the job.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "screen": "Applause, *without* the job",
   "at": "L5",
   "until": "L6"
  },
  {
   "say": "So let's climb down. What did governments actually do?",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "say": "Spain, in Morocco, the nineteen twenties: mustard gas on Rif villages.",
   "gap": 0.15,
   "screen": "Spain in Morocco, *1921 to 1927*",
   "at": "L7",
   "until": "L8"
  },
  {
   "say": "France, in Algeria: hundreds of thousands dead.",
   "gap": 0.15,
   "screen": "France in Algeria, *1954 to 1962*",
   "at": "L8",
   "until": "L9"
  },
  {
   "say": "Britain, in Kenya: one thousand and ninety Kenyans hanged.",
   "gap": 0.15,
   "screen": "Britain in Kenya, *1952 to 1960*",
   "at": "L9",
   "until": "L10"
  },
  {
   "say": "Syria's regime gassed its own suburbs: fourteen hundred dead in one night.",
   "gap": 0.15,
   "screen": "Assad regime, Ghouta, *Aug 2013*",
   "at": "L10",
   "until": "L11"
  },
  {
   "say": "And Iran wasn't even at war. It killed over five hundred fifty protesters.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "screen": "Iran's regime, protests, *2022*",
   "at": "L11",
   "until": "L12"
  },
  {
   "say": "Israel? Before striking, it warned.",
   "gap": 0.12,
   "screen": "Israel's warnings in Gaza",
   "at": "L12",
   "until": "L14"
  },
  {
   "say": "Seven point two million leaflets, thirteen point seven million texts, fifteen million calls.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "say": "At the top: utopia. No one harmed.",
   "gap": 0.15,
   "screen": "The *utopia* scale",
   "at": "L14",
   "until": "L16",
   "screen_y": 300
  },
  {
   "say": "Israel is far from perfect. But compared with these cases, it's not the outlier it's painted as.",
