  "text": "Easy to judge|from *up here*",
  "label": "What other governments actually did"
 },
 "caption_en": "Easy to judge from up here. 🐎\n\nThe accusations: Gaza's Health Ministry (run by HAMAS) counts 74,645 dead (10 Nov 2026), no civilian/fighter split. UN Satellite Centre (UNOSAT): 81% of structures damaged (Oct 2025). Military rule in the West Bank since 1967; UN OCHA: record settler attacks in 2026.\n\nWhat other governments did:\nSpain, Rif, 1921 to 1927: mustard gas, also from planes (Balfour, 2002).\nFrance, Algeria, 1954 to 1962: 350,000 dead (French est.) to 1.5M (FLN, National Liberation Front).\nBritain, Kenya: 1,090 hanged (Anderson, 2005); in 2013 the UK paid £19.9M to 5,228 torture victims.\nAssad regime, Ghouta, Aug 2013: sarin killed 1,429 (US Gov).\nIran's regime, 2022: 551+ protesters killed, no war (Iran Human Rights, 2023).\n\nIsrael's warnings, Oct 2023 to Jan 2024: 7.2M leaflets, 13.7M texts, 15M calls (IDF). Fighters among the dead: disputed (IDF says 22,000+).\n\nThe scale is our comparison, not a formula. By raw numbers some cases killed fewer than the Gaza war; we weigh warnings against deliberate attacks on civilians.\n\nIsrael is far from perfect, but not the outlier it's painted as. Every death in Gaza is a tragedy.\n\nPhotos: Abedallah Alhaj (CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO); Ricardo Martín (PD); Touring Club Italiano (CC BY-SA 4.0); Jerome KL (CC BY-SA 4.0); Ortho (CC BY-SA 4.0); IranAzadShod (CC0); Jaber Jehad Badwan (CC BY-SA 4.0); via Wikimedia Commons.\nAI voice. Send this to someone on a high horse.",
 "caption_he": "קל לשפוט מלמעלה.\n74,645 הרוגים בעזה לפי משרד הבריאות של חמאס, 81% מהמבנים נפגעו, ושיא באלימות מתנחלים. הביקורת אמיתית.\nאבל ספרד: גז חרדל על כפרים. צרפת: מאות אלפי הרוגים באלג'יריה. בריטניה: 1,090 תלויים בקניה. אסד: סארין. איראן: 551 מפגינים.\nישראל רחוקה משלמות, אבל היא לא החריגה. כל מוות בעזה הוא טרגדיה."
}